	(text "Ipp = 3.3/12.1 * (12.1 - 3.3)/(3.3uH * 580kHz) = 1.25 A\nIpeak = 0.5 + 1.25/2 = 1.125 A\nIlo(rms) = sqrt(0.5^{2}+1/12 Ipp^{2})= 0.62 A"
